  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "13. Terrain",
    "ruleNumber": "13.01",
    "summary": "Set up terrain before play. Choose any combination of these methods. Use a base or mat to mark a boundary and put one or more features entirely inside it. Place a single feature directly on the battlefield. Or place several features together and mark out their combined boundary. The ground each of these occupies is a terrain area. Use the boundaries on the mission's deployment map where provided. Otherwise, agree them before starting the battle.",
